            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-188] Garbage collection code is in the wrong place</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-188</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
